.SH "نام (NAME)"
git-remote-rad \- Git remote helper for Radicle
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBgit\-remote\-rad\fP *
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBgit\-remote\-rad\fP is a \fBgit\fP(1) remote helper program to allow git
to interact with the local Radicle storage. git will use this program
automatically, when using a remote repository with the "rad" protocol.
It is never invoked directly.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBgit\-remote\-helpers\fP(1), \fBrad\fP(1)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.sp
The Radicle Team